10:[["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border bg-[#eef3f8] py-16 text-slate-900 sm:py-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 opacity-70 [background-image:radial-gradient(circle_at_88%_12%,rgba(14,116,144,0.12),transparent_32%),radial-gradient(circle_at_10%_80%,rgba(37,99,235,0.10),transparent_36%)]"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container-site relative","children":[["$","$L1a",null,{"href":"/highlights/blogs","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-700 hover:text-teal-800","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left size-4"}],"All articles"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 max-w-4xl","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors border-transparent bg-secondary/10 text-secondary dark:text-blue-300","children":"App Development"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-heading text-4xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl","children":"App Development - The New Opportunity for High School Students"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-600","children":"Did you know we spend over 90% of our mobile time on using mobile apps? Surprising, isn’t it? But that’s true! Apps have become an integral part of our life, and they’ve become significant to the extent that we…"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-500","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"CITIS InfoTech Editorial"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M8 2v3","key":"1ioesn"}],["path",{"d":"M16 2v3","key":"otl347"}],["rect",{"x":"3","y":"3","width":"18","height":"18","rx":"2","key":"h1oib"}],["path",{"d":"M3 9h18","key":"1pudct"}],["path",{"d":"M8 13h.01","key":"1sbv64"}],["path",{"d":"M12 13h.01","key":"y0uutt"}],["path",{"d":"M16 13h.01","key":"wip0gl"}],["path",{"d":"M8 17h.01","key":"p3bg7i"}],["path",{"d":"M12 17h.01","key":"p32p05"}],["path",{"d":"M16 17h.01","key":"ql8jdd"}]],"className":"lucide-calendar-days size-4"}],"11 March 2021"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["path",{"d":"M12 6v6l4 2","key":"mmk7yg"}]],"className":"lucide-clock size-4"}],"5 min read"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-[#e8edf5] dark:bg-slate-900","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-site grid gap-10 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_13rem] lg:gap-16 lg:py-20","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl","children":[[["$","section","Overview",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Overview"}],[["$","p","Did you know we spend over 90% of our mobile time on using mobile apps? Surprising, isn’t it? But that’s true! Apps have become an integral part of our life, and they’ve become significant to the extent that we cannot imagine mobile use without apps.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Did you know we spend over 90% of our mobile time on using mobile apps? Surprising, isn’t it? But that’s true! Apps have become an integral part of our life, and they’ve become significant to the extent that we cannot imagine mobile use without apps."}],["$","p","Mobile apps have come a long way. They’ve evolved from mere information databases to platforms that run business, process data, help you buy your favorite pair of sunglasses, and do many other activities.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Mobile apps have come a long way. They’ve evolved from mere information databases to platforms that run business, process data, help you buy your favorite pair of sunglasses, and do many other activities."}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]]}],"$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26"],"$L27"]}],"$L28"]}]}]]}],"$L29","$L2a"]
1c:["$","p","A lot of global enterprises, on the other hand, are increasingly relying on the development of mobile apps to increase their business. They continually hire mobile app developers capable of creating engaging, intriguing, and interactive mobile apps to help them grow and outperform their peers.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"A lot of global enterprises, on the other hand, are increasingly relying on the development of mobile apps to increase their business. They continually hire mobile app developers capable of creating engaging, intriguing, and interactive mobile apps to help them grow and outperform their peers."}]
1d:["$","p","But, being a mobile app developer isn’t as apparent. It demands a comprehensive understanding of user experience, user expectations, and cognizance of the technology in use to deliver an efficient app.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"But, being a mobile app developer isn’t as apparent. It demands a comprehensive understanding of user experience, user expectations, and cognizance of the technology in use to deliver an efficient app."}]
1e:["$","p","Most of the app developers that we see around are the ones who’ve learned app development at a very later stage in life. They’ve either taken it up after college or learned it while pursuing graduation.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Most of the app developers that we see around are the ones who’ve learned app development at a very later stage in life. They’ve either taken it up after college or learned it while pursuing graduation."}]
1f:["$","p","But, if apps are here to stay for a long time, and if developing engaging apps is going to constitute the future of a lot of businesses, we must create a generation that possesses exceptional proficiency at app development. Hence, schools must catch students young, and let them, right from their high school years, develop the skill of app development, and tap the career opportunities to follow.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"But, if apps are here to stay for a long time, and if developing engaging apps is going to constitute the future of a lot of businesses, we must create a generation that possesses exceptional proficiency at app development. Hence, schools must catch students young, and let them, right from their high school years, develop the skill of app development, and tap the career opportunities to follow."}]
20:["$","section","Reasons why High School Students must learn App Development",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Reasons why High School Students must learn App Development"}],[["$","p","Of course, career is one, and also the most critical of all aspects. But that’s not the only one. So, let us not restrict our thought process to quantifying app development benefits into higher employability and salary packages. Instead, let us look at the benefits of app development holistically.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Of course, career is one, and also the most critical of all aspects. But that’s not the only one. So, let us not restrict our thought process to quantifying app development benefits into higher employability and salary packages. Instead, let us look at the benefits of app development holistically."}],["$","p","App development, at a stage, as early as high school, can prove advantageous in several other ways. So, let us take a look at some solid reasons that indicate the need to learn app development during high school. At the same time, let us also explore how it proves a fresh opportunity for high school students to develop various sustainable personal as well as professional skills.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"App development, at a stage, as early as high school, can prove advantageous in several other ways. So, let us take a look at some solid reasons that indicate the need to learn app development during high school. At the same time, let us also explore how it proves a fresh opportunity for high school students to develop various sustainable personal as well as professional skills."}]]]}]
21:["$","section","Learning STEAM Skills",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Learning STEAM Skills"}],[["$","p","STEAM, as we all know, is the acronym for Science, Technology, Engineering, Art, and Mathematics. Classroom app development sessions help students learn and apply STEAM skills. They also learn vital technical skills relating to STEAM, such as coding, graphic designing, programming, and content creation.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"STEAM, as we all know, is the acronym for Science, Technology, Engineering, Art, and Mathematics. Classroom app development sessions help students learn and apply STEAM skills. They also learn vital technical skills relating to STEAM, such as coding, graphic designing, programming, and content creation."}],["$","p","Developing these skills at such a young age and further upgrading them helps students maintain their competence amidst the highly competitive world of technology.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Developing these skills at such a young age and further upgrading them helps students maintain their competence amidst the highly competitive world of technology."}]]]}]
22:["$","section","Resolving Real-World Problems",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Resolving Real-World Problems"}],[["$","p","App development lets students take a sneak peek into real-world problems they may face when they step out of the egg. Through digital designs, they get an opportunity to resolve real-time concerns such as academic challenges, community-related problems, and many others.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"App development lets students take a sneak peek into real-world problems they may face when they step out of the egg. Through digital designs, they get an opportunity to resolve real-time concerns such as academic challenges, community-related problems, and many others."}],["$","p","Learning to develop apps helps students leverage technology and their natural intellect to change their environment. Such practical learning isn’t possible while confining their exposure to bookish theories.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Learning to develop apps helps students leverage technology and their natural intellect to change their environment. Such practical learning isn’t possible while confining their exposure to bookish theories."}]]]}]
23:["$","section","Bringing out and Enhancing the Creative Aspect of Students",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Bringing out and Enhancing the Creative Aspect of Students"}],[["$","p","Technological competence isn’t the only element that strengthens with app development. The activity also fosters art and creativity. Creativity is something that transcends right and wrong. It lets students enjoy the app development activity without the fear of going wrong or failing anywhere.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Technological competence isn’t the only element that strengthens with app development. The activity also fosters art and creativity. Creativity is something that transcends right and wrong. It lets students enjoy the app development activity without the fear of going wrong or failing anywhere."}],["$","p","App development helps bring creativity out of students and helps them develop a thought process that blends technology and creativity. Students that learn app development in the early years are in a better position to resolve complex business concerns. Such proves instrumental in helping them move up ranks quickly, despite the highly competitive business world.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"App development helps bring creativity out of students and helps them develop a thought process that blends technology and creativity. Students that learn app development in the early years are in a better position to resolve complex business concerns. Such proves instrumental in helping them move up ranks quickly, despite the highly competitive business world."}]]]}]
24:["$","section","Learning Coding and Developing Computational Thinking",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Learning Coding and Developing Computational Thinking"}],[["$","p","Learning app development at an early stage helps students explore a range of latest digital technologies, develop computational thinking for digital technologies, designing and developing digital results, and learn the skill of design and visual communication.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Learning app development at an early stage helps students explore a range of latest digital technologies, develop computational thinking for digital technologies, designing and developing digital results, and learn the skill of design and visual communication."}],["$","p","These skills prove handy in the long run, as such students don’t limit themselves to technical proficiency but extend it to possessing an in-built, technology-oriented, strategic and solution-based approach that makes them stand out from the crowd, and makes them an asset for their employer.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"These skills prove handy in the long run, as such students don’t limit themselves to technical proficiency but extend it to possessing an in-built, technology-oriented, strategic and solution-based approach that makes them stand out from the crowd, and makes them an asset for their employer."}]]]}]
25:["$","section","Developing Collaborative Skills",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Developing Collaborative Skills"}],[["$","p","Team playing is among the most critical skills that learning app development, at such an early age, develops. Students work as a team and develop and apply collaborative intellect. They create real-world apps that prove a technical and creative solution to modern-day business concerns.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Team playing is among the most critical skills that learning app development, at such an early age, develops. Students work as a team and develop and apply collaborative intellect. They create real-world apps that prove a technical and creative solution to modern-day business concerns."}],["$","p","These days, when companies struggle to find good team players, learning app development in the growing age is beneficial to the students as well as the companies that look forward to employing them.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"These days, when companies struggle to find good team players, learning app development in the growing age is beneficial to the students as well as the companies that look forward to employing them."}]]]}]
26:["$","section","Conclusion",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Conclusion"}],[["$","p","Learning app development in the high school age proves a futuristic approach. It fosters technical expertise and develops the capabilities to blend technology and creativity to resolve complex business concerns and serve diverse social needs.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Learning app development in the high school age proves a futuristic approach. It fosters technical expertise and develops the capabilities to blend technology and creativity to resolve complex business concerns and serve diverse social needs."}],["$","p","At CITIS Infotech, we are a group of visionary education technology professionals that promote extra-curricular activities and studies for high school students, out of which, app development is one.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"At CITIS Infotech, we are a group of visionary education technology professionals that promote extra-curricular activities and studies for high school students, out of which, app development is one."}],["$","p","We believe in developing skills for tomorrow and, therefore, help schools develop app development curricula for high school students. Our app development curriculum has helped a lot of schools bring the best of their students' creativity and enhance their technological competence.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"We believe in developing skills for tomorrow and, therefore, help schools develop app development curricula for high school students. Our app development curriculum has helped a lot of schools bring the best of their students' creativity and enhance their technological competence."}]]]}]
27:["$","aside",null,{"className":"mt-12 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-accent bg-primary/5 p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-heading text-xl font-semibold","children":"The practical takeaway"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-muted-foreground","children":"Start with one meaningful learner outcome, create an authentic way to observe it, and support educators to improve the experience together."}]]}]
